{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的感受信息有时过于密集，纵向交替阅读需要不断切换注意力，Y 左右分栏、主叙事与感受分离的结构更容易快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 虽然信息更密，但重点词放大加亮、感受文字缩小，以及感受随音乐段落适时出现，让观众能先抓住人物当下的核心处境，再逐步感受到情绪变化。尤其是从提醒自己为何离开，到承认怀念亲近、害怕孤独，再到不因想念而委屈自己，X 把人物矛盾的来由和转变交代得更具体，也通过音乐细节让前后情绪形成连续的呼应。Y 的优势是左右分栏清楚、叙事句子顺畅，但不少细腻的心理层次和音乐变化被压缩成概括性短词，观众比较容易看懂故事，却较难获得同等具体的感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "adbb5189-9a0e-4b91-b491-a1cbe50f2bd1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022345909309Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:24:29.748294+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6d60082142f9a281469737a87de54bfc6ac8221decd2771507a15a29bd69c903", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42